296
00:23:57,560 --> 00:23:58,800
I'll get even worse!

297
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,280
He hasn't changed at all.

298
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:54,880
It's okay.

299
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,480
Aside from here,

300
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,040
