301
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:29,560
It's okay.

302
00:26:30,760 --> 00:26:31,840
Don't cry.

303
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,440
About the job...

304
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:50,640
I think...

305
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:55,680
About the job...

306
00:26:57,040 --> 00:26:58,240
You don't need to worry.

307
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:02,080
I'll do my best.

308
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:05,080
I've been through a lot.

309
00:27:11,560 --> 00:27:12,880
Been through a lot?

310
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,360
Maybe

311
00:27:16,360 --> 00:27:17,480
I shouldn't have interrupted Sam,

312
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:19,680
so you'd have more options to choose from.

313
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,560
You don't seem shaken

314
00:27:22,560 --> 00:27:23,640
anyway.

315
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:36,080
Please move.

316
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:38,720
I'm going to look after Madam.

317
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:55,320
♪ I want to tell you so you'll understand ♪

318
00:27:55,800 --> 00:27:59,560
♪ But how much longer ♪

319
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:04,920
♪ Can I keep all these words inside? ♪

320
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:09,520
♪ Every time we meet ♪

321
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:13,400
