342
00:30:01,840 --> 00:30:03,640
Is this position comfortable?

343
00:30:04,320 --> 00:30:05,320
Yes, dear.

344
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:08,520
Shall I adjust anything else?

345
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:10,200
No need. It's fine.

346
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:19,160
Hello, Mom.

347
00:30:21,280 --> 00:30:23,560
Guess who this is, ma'am?

348
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:28,680
Nueng, of course.

349
00:30:31,280 --> 00:30:32,480
That's right, Mom.

350
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:33,640
It's Nueng.

351
00:30:34,840 --> 00:30:36,000
How pretty you are.

352
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:41,440
It's time for your meal.

353
00:30:43,360 --> 00:30:44,680
Have you eaten, Nueng?

354
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:46,840
I've finished already.

355
00:30:47,120 --> 00:30:48,040
You go ahead and eat.

356
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:00,360
Ms. Oh,

357
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:04,960
