358
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:14,760
First of all,

359
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:17,160
I must apologize

360
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:19,720
for how my brother treated you.

361
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:22,560
Yes.

362
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:24,400
And as for my mother,

363
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:29,560
thank you so much. Truly.

364
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:32,640
I can't think of a better way

365
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:34,040
to express my gratitude.

366
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,600
Please don't mention it.

367
00:31:35,600 --> 00:31:36,800
It's my duty.

368
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,640
Song.

369
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:42,320
Hi, Nueng.

370
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:49,760
Sorry to put you through this.

371
00:31:50,600 --> 00:31:52,240
It's nothing. Don't worry about it.

372
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:55,200
If you get tired of running the café,

373
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,160
you can come back to our company.

374
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,880
There's always a position for you.

375
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:00,640
Hmm...

376
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:02,640
I'd rather not.

377
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,880
It's not really my strength.

378
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:06,000
But if there's ever a problem,

379
00:32:06,600 --> 00:32:08,000
