380
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:14,240
Mom,

381
00:32:14,600 --> 00:32:15,760
I'm heading out now.

382
00:32:16,320 --> 00:32:17,600
All right.

383
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:21,360
Go get ready.

384
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:23,520
You've got five minutes.

385
00:32:23,520 --> 00:32:25,200
We're going out for work.

386
00:32:25,600 --> 00:32:26,840
Sorry?

387
00:32:26,840 --> 00:32:28,040
Going out for work?

388
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,440
Yes, go.

389
00:32:32,360 --> 00:32:34,000
Or would you rather go like that?

390
00:32:35,080 --> 00:32:36,080
All right.

391
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:06,840
Are you getting in or not?

392
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:08,040
Standing there like a post.

393
00:33:08,040 --> 00:33:09,880
Do I have to open the door for you?

394
00:33:10,080 --> 00:33:11,080
It's just...

395
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,320
What now?

396
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:15,760
Must there be a red carpet

397
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:16,720
before you'll get in?

398
00:33:49,360 --> 00:33:50,360
Buckle up.

399
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:02,680
I can do it myself.

400
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:05,040
Give it here.

401
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,199
Is spending a day out with me

402
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:22,199
going to kill you?

403
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,480
No, it won't.

404
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:27,600
Then why make such a fuss?

405
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:28,960
You're wasting my time.

406
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,960
Then what do you want me to do?

407
00:34:31,239 --> 00:34:32,199
If I sit in front,

408
00:34:32,199 --> 00:34:33,360
I'm afraid you'll scold me.

409
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:34,199
If I sit in back,

410
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:35,520
you'll say I'm acting like the boss.

411
00:34:35,520 --> 00:34:37,000
I don't know how to act anymore.

412
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:41,480
Have you ever done

413
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:42,760
anything right?

414
00:34:45,040 --> 00:34:49,120
