439
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:09,760
Oh.

440
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:13,240
So annoying!

441
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:15,080
Stay out of my life!

442
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:27,920
Wake up.

443
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:31,960
I brought you here to work,

444
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,360
and you're sitting there asleep.

445
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:35,160
I thought you've been through a lot.

446
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:36,400
Have you really?

447
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:38,600
I'm sorry.

448
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:00,040
Ms. Oh?

449
00:38:00,240 --> 00:38:01,240
Hello.

450
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:02,960
Is everyone here?

451
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:05,120
Yes, they're all waiting inside.

452
00:38:05,120 --> 00:38:06,160
This way, please.

453
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:15,800
That backdrop at the entrance,

454
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:16,920
the one I told you to fix,

455
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:18,080
will it be ready in time?

456
00:38:18,080 --> 00:38:19,280
Don't forget to double-check

457
00:38:19,280 --> 00:38:20,240
that it'll be ready.

458
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:21,240
Oh!

459
00:38:22,120 --> 00:38:23,520
Ms. Song, hello.

460
00:38:26,240 --> 00:38:27,600
Go sit and wait over there.

461
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:29,360
Yes.

462
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:45,720
This area will serve as the event stage.

463
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:47,520
The natural scenery in the background

464
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:48,640
will blend in,

465
00:38:50,080 --> 00:38:51,640
like in the pictures we sent you.

466
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,720
And the area over there

467
00:38:53,720 --> 00:38:56,280
will be used to receive the VIP guests.

468
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,440
And the floor?

469
00:38:58,440 --> 00:39:00,520
Will you add carpet or anything else?

470
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:03,160
We won't lay carpet in this area

471
00:39:03,160 --> 00:39:04,240
to keep it consistent

472
00:39:04,240 --> 00:39:05,360
with the natural look.

473
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:06,720
But at the front,

474
00:39:06,720 --> 00:39:07,920
we'll have carpet

475
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:10,440
for the event guests.

476
00:39:11,120 --> 00:39:12,240
For the VIP guests,

477
00:39:12,240 --> 00:39:13,760
we'll set up this area

478
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:16,640
as a lounge area where they can relax.

479
00:39:31,120 --> 00:39:33,040
Do you have anything to add, Ms. Song?

480
00:39:33,720 --> 00:39:35,600
Nothing. You can go ahead as planned.

481
00:39:35,600 --> 00:39:36,600
Understood.

482
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:38,400
Please follow what Ms. Song said.

483
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:47,840
No need to see us off.

484
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,560
Just handle everything here.

485
00:39:49,560 --> 00:39:50,560
Of course.

486
00:40:06,200 --> 00:40:07,240
Thank you.

487
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:08,240
Thank you.

488
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,920
Eat up.

489
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:17,240
Well...

490
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:41,000
I'm full.

491
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,640
I'm going back to work.

492
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:49,000
Whether you eat or not is up to you.

493
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:52,280
And don't even think about taking any home.

494
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,320
She ordered so much.

495
00:41:07,080 --> 00:41:08,080
What a waste.

496
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:11,040
It'd be nice if Mom and Ong could eat this too.

497
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:54,840
Thank you.

498
00:42:02,600 --> 00:42:03,600
Thank you.

499
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,400
The bill, please.

500
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:12,480
Hey, you haven't touched your dessert.

501
00:43:14,560 --> 00:43:16,280
I gave up dessert a long time ago.

502
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:18,440
Huh?

503
00:43:47,840 --> 00:43:49,800
PROFESSOR SMITH

504
00:43:58,680 --> 00:43:59,680
Yes, Smith.

505
00:43:59,920 --> 00:44:01,760
I heard about what Mr. Sam did yesterday.

506
00:44:01,760 --> 00:44:03,000
How are you, Oh?

507
00:44:05,600 --> 00:44:06,960
Uh...

508
00:44:07,200 --> 00:44:08,440
I'm not hurt anywhere.

509
00:44:09,160 --> 00:44:10,520
How about quitting?

510
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:12,120
I'll talk to them

511
00:44:12,120 --> 00:44:13,040
about canceling the contract.

512
00:44:17,200 --> 00:44:18,280
It's all right.

513
00:44:18,560 --> 00:44:19,680
I can still manage.

514
00:44:20,040 --> 00:44:21,240
Please don't worry, Smith.

515
00:44:21,520 --> 00:44:22,680
Of course I worry.

516
00:44:23,520 --> 00:44:24,960
- This matter--
- Smith.

517
00:44:25,920 --> 00:44:27,680
Let's talk later, okay?

518
00:44:27,680 --> 00:44:28,720
All right.

519
00:44:30,440 --> 00:44:32,720
Are you close to getting back?

520
00:44:33,680 --> 00:44:34,760
So I can wait and see you.

521
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:36,320
Uh...

522
00:44:36,800 --> 00:44:38,960
I'm not sure when it'll be done here.

523
00:44:39,400 --> 00:44:40,800
Is there something you need?

524
00:44:41,280 --> 00:44:42,360
I brought some éclairs

525
00:44:42,360 --> 00:44:43,520
from your usual shop for you.

526
00:44:44,960 --> 00:44:46,640
But if you're not finished yet,

527
00:44:46,920 --> 00:44:48,240
I'll leave them with Cream.

528
00:44:48,720 --> 00:44:49,720
Thank you so much.

529
00:44:50,160 --> 00:44:51,240
Then I'll hang up now.

530
00:44:51,720 --> 00:44:52,720
Okay.

531
00:44:53,520 --> 00:44:54,520
Bye.

532
00:45:11,720 --> 00:45:13,280
You're so sweet to Smith.

533
00:45:13,560 --> 00:45:15,560
"Smith this. Smith that."

534
00:45:15,880 --> 00:45:17,360
When you looked scared of Sam,

535
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:18,800
that was just an act, wasn't it?

536
00:45:19,120 --> 00:45:22,040
You're so fake, so phony.

537
00:45:23,080 --> 00:45:25,240
- Phony?
- Stop acting innocent.

538
00:45:25,600 --> 00:45:26,680
Get out!

539
00:45:27,640 --> 00:45:28,800
What's wrong with you?

540
00:45:29,040 --> 00:45:30,240
I said get out!

541
00:46:20,640 --> 00:46:21,760
Hey.

542
00:46:22,360 --> 00:46:23,360
You're back.

543
00:46:25,960 --> 00:46:27,400
What's wrong?

544
00:46:27,400 --> 00:46:29,080
Why are you drenched in sweat?

545
00:46:29,640 --> 00:46:30,880
And your face is pale too.

546
00:46:32,240 --> 00:46:34,360
I walked back. There weren't any cars.

547
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:37,400
Why didn't you call me?

548
00:46:40,920 --> 00:46:42,440
Dr. Smith left some sweets for you.

549
00:46:42,760 --> 00:46:43,840
I put them on the counter

550
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:44,840
in the main kitchen.

551
00:46:45,480 --> 00:46:46,520
Thanks, Cream.

552
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:51,440
Who's that?

553
00:46:51,440 --> 00:46:52,480
I'll go check first.

554
00:47:19,720 --> 00:47:20,720
Oops.

555
00:47:21,320 --> 00:47:22,240
Sorry.

556
00:47:22,840 --> 00:47:24,200
Do you have to go this far?

557
00:47:24,720 --> 00:47:26,480
Do you have a problem with it?

558
00:47:27,360 --> 00:47:28,600
If you hate me this much,

559
00:47:29,240 --> 00:47:30,240
why keep me here

560
00:47:30,240 --> 00:47:31,480
as your eyesore?

561
00:47:31,880 --> 00:47:32,960
I don't understand.

562
00:47:33,400 --> 00:47:34,720
What do you want from me?

563
00:47:35,080 --> 00:47:36,680
What I want is my own business.

564
00:47:37,840 --> 00:47:38,920
A hired hand

565
00:47:38,920 --> 00:47:40,320
has no right to ask me that.

566
00:47:43,480 --> 00:47:44,560
Then I apologize.

567
00:47:52,360 --> 00:47:53,360
Oh?

568
00:47:55,080 --> 00:47:55,920
Oh!

569
00:47:55,920 --> 00:47:56,920
Oh!

570
00:47:57,440 --> 00:47:58,120
Oh!

571
00:47:58,120 --> 00:47:59,360
What's wrong, Oh?

572
00:47:59,360 --> 00:48:00,160
Oh!

573
00:48:20,520 --> 00:48:22,200
I should take Oh to the hospital.

574
00:48:22,200 --> 00:48:23,440
No need.

575
00:48:23,600 --> 00:48:25,480
I can take care of my people.

576
00:48:26,280 --> 00:48:27,880
You made me this way.

577
00:48:27,880 --> 00:48:28,920
Don't you think

578
00:48:28,920 --> 00:48:29,800
you should take responsibility?

579
00:48:29,800 --> 00:48:31,240
Last night you slept with one person,

580
00:48:31,240 --> 00:48:32,800
and today you went off with another.

581
00:48:32,800 --> 00:48:34,760
So, did you get your fill?

582
00:48:35,840 --> 00:48:37,320
I thought the two of us

583
00:48:37,320 --> 00:48:38,280
could go back to how we were.

584
00:48:38,280 --> 00:48:40,080
What are you trying to come back to

585
00:48:40,080 --> 00:48:41,320
