586
00:48:46,040 --> 00:48:48,560
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

587
00:48:48,560 --> 00:48:52,240
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

588
00:48:52,240 --> 00:48:57,440
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

589
